<%- include('partials/page-start', { includeHeroHeader: false, pageTitle: 'Privacy - OneLife' }) %>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-12 text-sm leading-7 text-gray-600">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Privacy and data use</h1>
  <p class="mt-5">OneLife uses the information you provide to create and manage appointments, communicate booking updates, and operate your account. We only ask for details relevant to providing these services.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Your health information</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">Appointment details and messages may contain sensitive information. Do not share emergency information through this website. Access is limited to the patient, assigned clinician, and authorized hospital administrators.</p>
  <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Your choices</h2>
  <p class="mt-2">You can review and update your profile, cancel an appointment, or contact support about your data. Before launch, the hospital operator should add its legal entity, physical address, retention period, and local regulatory contact details.</p>
</section>
<%- include('partials/page-end') %>
